# Grid: Horizontal and Vertical align the items in their cells, for the whole Grid or for one Area, and Layer orders overlapping items.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Grid · Alignment and Layer
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Section:
		Text: Grid
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Alignment and Layer
		Paragraph: By default each item stretches to fill its cell. With `left`, `right`, `top`, `bottom` or `center` it keeps its own size and moves inside the cell. An `Area` can override the alignment of its `Grid`, and `Layer` on two `Area` that share cells decides which is on top.
